          "actualOutput": "Teorema Elkan tau* teoretis : 0.0300\nThreshold 0.50 (Default)    : Acc=0.9925 | Recall=0.6250 | Cost=$7,275.00\nThreshold Elkan (0.03)      : Acc=0.3525 | Recall=1.0000 | Cost=$19,425.00\nThreshold Empiris Terbaik   : tau=0.250 | Min Cost=$1,270.00\nPenghematan Finansial       : $-12,150.00 per 2.000 transaksi",
