          "id": "code-ml-01-2-ch01_2_scratch",
          "title": "First-Principles: InfoNCE Contrastive Loss Stabil Log-Sum-Exp",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "01_2_infonce_contrastive_scratch.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\n\ndef infonce_contrastive_loss(q: np.ndarray, k_pos: np.ndarray,\n                             k_negs: np.ndarray, temperature: float = 0.1) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Menghitung InfoNCE loss stabil numerik (Log-Sum-Exp) untuk Self-Supervised Learning.\"\"\"\n    def l2_norm(v: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n        return v / np.maximum(np.linalg.norm(v, axis=-1, keepdims=True), 1e-12)\n\n    qn = l2_norm(q)\n    pn = l2_norm(k_pos)\n    nn = l2_norm(k_negs)\n\n    pos_logit = np.sum(qn * pn, axis=-1, keepdims=True) / temperature\n    neg_logits = (qn @ nn.T) / temperature\n    logits = np.concatenate([pos_logit, neg_logits], axis=-1)\n\n    # Stabilisasi Log-Sum-Exp agar bebas overflow\n    max_logit = np.max(logits, axis=-1, keepdims=True)\n    log_denom = max_logit + np.log(np.sum(np.exp(logits - max_logit), axis=-1, keepdims=True))\n    loss = -(pos_logit - log_denom)\n    return float(np.mean(loss))\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(42)\nbatch_size, dim, n_neg = 32, 16, 64\nbase_emb = rng.normal(0, 1, size=(batch_size, dim))\n# Augmentasi positif dekat secara kosinus; negatif acak independen\npos_close = base_emb + rng.normal(0, 0.15, size=(batch_size, dim))\npos_noisy = base_emb + rng.normal(0, 1.50, size=(batch_size, dim))\nnegs = rng.normal(0, 1, size=(n_neg, dim))\n\nloss_aligned = infonce_contrastive_loss(base_emb, pos_close, negs, temperature=0.1)\nloss_collapsed = infonce_contrastive_loss(base_emb, pos_noisy, negs, temperature=0.1)\nrandom_chance_loss = float(np.log(n_neg + 1))\n\nprint(f\"InfoNCE Loss (Representasi Terkalibrasi) : {loss_aligned:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"InfoNCE Loss (Augmentasi Terlalu Berisik): {loss_collapsed:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"Batas Acak Teoretis ln(K+1) = ln(65)     : {random_chance_loss:.4f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "InfoNCE Loss (Representasi Terkalibrasi) : 0.0413\nInfoNCE Loss (Augmentasi Terlalu Berisik): 2.0086\nBatas Acak Teoretis ln(K+1) = ln(65)     : 4.1744",
